    "updated_at": "2021-09-30T13:42:50Z",
    "body": "@chipbuster I've implemented something close to that first option you suggest - as far as i see, all the plugins are exposing outside information as variables, and these then inserted using formats - by escaping all the variables, we keep the user safe from whatever the module has inserted to the variable - but still let an advanced user insert some special chars in the format string itself.\r\n\r\nI've also made a special variable type that avoids escaping, which for the custom command is useful, potentially elsewhere and is effectively like a passthough",
